				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				690b23
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				107.1
			</span></i>; of a flute, <i>without reed</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.108
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τως</span>”
